      "cooked": "<p>A relatively short Editor’s note&nbsp;<a href=\"http://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-22\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-22</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Release schedule for October:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t\tTuesday, October 2nd: Episode #85: Create a Story Live! (Recording today! September 20th)</li>\n\t<li>\n\t\tTuesday, October 9th: Episode #86: Story Arc: Burying the Blade (Recording tomorrow! September 21st)</li>\n\t<li>\n\t\tTuesday, October 16th: Episode #87: SCAUniverse, Phase Two (Part 2)</li>\n\t<li>\n\t\tThursday, October 18th: Extrasode #7: Casting the Voices of Sentinel Comics</li>\n\t<li>\n\t\tTuesday, October 23rd: Episode #88: The Art and Mechanics of Incapacitation</li>\n\t<li>\n\t\tThursday, October 25th: Editor’s Note #23</li>\n\t<li>\n\t\tTuesday, October 30th: Episode #89: Something Wicked… (Halloween Special)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Recording Schedule for October:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t\tThursday, October 11th: Extrasode #7: Casting the Voices of Sentinel Comics</li>\n\t<li>\n\t\tFriday, October 12th: Episode #87: SCAUniverse, Phase Two (Part 2)</li>\n\t<li>\n\t\tThursday, October 18th: Editor’s Note #23</li>\n\t<li>\n\t\tFriday, October 19th: Episode #88: The Art and Mechanics of Incapacitation</li>\n\t<li>\n\t\tFriday, October 26th: Episode #89: Something Wicked… (Halloween Special)</li>\n</ul>",
