      "id": 222351,
      "name": "Basketkeep",
      "username": "Basketkeep",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/basketkeep/{size}/2145_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-09-22T01:00:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>…I could have sworn this was supposed to come out next week. &lt;.&lt; I even wrote it on my calendar. Mistake on my part?<br><br>\n…Wow, that superpet letter is an old one, if I’m not mistaken! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> I also recently wrote a question about manga, so it’s good to get something of a side answer to that, too.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I didn’t even know it was out until this evening. I checked the schedule from the previous Editor’s Note and it does say September 27th. Did they change the schedule ever and I’m just missing something? All that said, still a great episode! <em>Now I just have to wait 4 more days…</em></p>",
